This package is a FlutterFire platform implementation: it implements the
platform interface of the FlutterFire firebase_analytics plugin
(firebase_analytics_platform_interface, Copyright 2021 the Chromium project
authors, BSD 3-Clause license) and the platform interface of firebase_core
(firebase_core_platform_interface, BSD 3-Clause license). It depends on those
packages; it does not copy their code. The work is done by
firebase_analytics_dart, an unofficial client of the Google Analytics 4
Measurement Protocol.

